<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT ETHIOPIA IN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT ETHIOPIA IN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat Ethiopia 4-0 (halftime 3-O) in an African Nations Cup group three qualify match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Said Chiba 8, Ahmed Baeja 18, Noureddine Naybet 34, Hadrioui Abdelkrim 81.</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000.</p>
</text>
